--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fc730475ed18dc949b8c9fd8435ab43e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Floor1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  introLines: []
  casualLines:
  - 'You are in the elevator wanting to go home. '
  - After a long day being stucked in the office, what is better than a relaxing
    evening on your couches, watching your favourite movie
  - But then you realised, why haven't you gotten out of the elevator yet?
  - And why is there no Ground Floor?
  - You click the open button, and walk forward. You could have gone back. You did
    not.
  - The walls were too clean, too perfect. You still kept walking.
  - Walk. To find the exit or maybe to notice something different than this plain
    boring hallway
  - Wait... You thought. Why is the hallway not ending?
  - You reached another hallway. It was identical to the last. And the one before
    that.
  - You wondered, for a moment, if you had been walking forever.
  - Should you go back? But the elevator is not there anymore!
  - You kept walking and walking but the hallway kept you.
  - You paused. And then moved. The decision was yours, wasn't it?
  - You were right, you told yourself. You always were.
  - You did not know what was beneath the floor, or behind the ceiling, or inside
    the walls.
  - You did not know what was beneath the floor, or behind the ceiling, or inside
    the walls.
  - Someone-or something-had been here before. You could feel it. Not in your mind.
    Not yet.
  - Every step sounds the same. Perfect. Predictable. Controlled
  - What you did not know was that the hallway had a memory. And it remembered everything
    you had forgotten.
  - "It\u2019s getting colder now. Do you feel it?"
  - "The sound you hear isn\u2019t the vent... it\u2019s breathing. Slow. Familiar."
  - "Pretend it didn\u2019t happen. You\u2019re good at that."
  - "Keep walking. You\u2019ll forget soon enough"
  - "Don\u2019t worry. I\u2019ll be with you the whole way. I always am."
  - Have you ever wonder why there is this annoying narrator?
  - Well, let me tell you... I am actually inside your head
  - You created me and all I did was narrating.
  - Something shifted behind the walls.
  - "You were certain this hallway ended at a door. It doesn\u2019t anymore."
  - "The last person who made it this far didn\u2019t come back the same."
  - Something wrote your name on the patient chart. The ink is still wet.
  - "The vents are whispering again. Don\u2019t listen too long."
  - "You told yourself it wasn\u2019t your fault. Over and over."
  - But have you ever wondered why you are trapped here?
  - Was this all a dream or your own hallucination?
  - We never know... we never know.....
  eventPresets:
  - state: 2
    lines:
    - You shouldn't have looked at that
    - I didn't write it.
    - You don't want to know what it means.
    triggerOnce: 1
    triggered: 0
  - state: 1
    lines:
    - Ah light. In a few seconds, you will definitely pick it up.
    - Turn it on. Press F
    - "Last time you had that, you saw something you weren\u2019t meant to"
    triggerOnce: 1
    triggered: 0
  - state: 3
    lines:
    - Hold on... Did you hear that?
    - The walls are thinner now. The sounds leak through
    triggerOnce: 1
    triggered: 0
  - state: 4
    lines:
    - You heard it again, didn't you?
    - It's getting closer. The sound. The memory.
    - Maybe it is your memory
    - Maybe it's trying to tell you something
    - Have you ever thought that you were dead already
    - You should have left when you could
    triggerOnce: 1
    triggered: 0
  - state: 5
    lines:
    - Oh, him again. Still walking. Still pretending
    - "He thinks this corridor leads home. He\u2019s wrong, but I let him dream."
    - "Don\u2019t speak to him. He\u2019ll mistake you for someone he buried."
    - Or maybe he is dead as well.
    - "When he passes you, don\u2019t breathe. It confuses him."
    triggerOnce: 1
    triggered: 0
  - state: 6
    lines:
    - "Did you really think there\u2019d be an ending?"
    - "You\u2019ve done this before. I\u2019ve said these words before."
    - "Maybe this time you\u2019ll listen."
    - "Don\u2019t turn around. Not yet."
    - ...
    - "It\u2019s behind you."
    triggerOnce: 1
    triggered: 0
  - state: 7
    lines:
    - 'Wait, where are you going? '
    - Other floors won't make any difference.
    - Dont' leave!
    triggerOnce: 1
    triggered: 0
  - state: 8
    lines:
    - What!? How? You found the secret code.
    - But... did you know that, there is no such thing as 'exit'
    triggerOnce: 1
    triggered: 0
